1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,171
Pangaea never
finished breaking up.

2
00:00:02,566 --> 00:00:04,354
Europe and America
are still drifting

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:04,957
apart.

4
00:00:05,352 --> 00:00:07,512
You can't feel it,
because the Atlantic

5
00:00:07,558 --> 00:00:09,625
grows just two and a
half centimeters a

6
00:00:09,694 --> 00:00:10,101
year.

7
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:12,283
Slower than your
fingernails.

8
00:00:12,817 --> 00:00:14,803
Since Columbus
crossed it, that's about

9
00:00:14,849 --> 00:00:15,767
thirteen meters.

10
00:00:16,394 --> 00:00:17,694
Longer than a
city bus.

11
00:00:17,938 --> 00:00:19,493
Over a hundred and
seventy-five million

12
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:21,514
years, those
centimeters tore Pangaea

13
00:00:21,572 --> 00:00:24,079
apart and opened
a whole ocean.

14
00:00:24,613 --> 00:00:27,005
In Iceland, the seam
rises from the sea,

15
